{"text":"It's your generation and your children that are going to be impacted. That's why it's urgent that we begin this work right now. Development that lifts up the lives and health of our people. Trade and economic partnerships that reduce poverty and create opportunity. Leadership in the world that defends our security and advances human dignity and protects our planet. That's what I believe India and America can do together. So for the rest of my time, I want to discuss how we can do it. Because in big and diverse societies like ours, progress ultimately depends on something more basic, and that is how we see each other. And we know from experience what makes nations strong. And they have, I think, did a great job of describing the essence of what's important here. We are strongest when we see the inherent dignity in every human being.","words":[{"text":"It's","start":0.6,"end":1.08},{"text":"your","start":1.08,"end":1.24},{"text":"generation","start":1.24,"end":1.68},{"text":"and","start":1.68,"end":2.14},{"text":"your","start":2.14,"end":2.26},{"text":"children","start":2.26,"end":2.56},{"text":"that","start":2.56,"end":3.02},{"text":"are","start":3.02,"end":3.1},{"text":"going","start":3.1,"end":3.16},{"text":"to","start":3.16,"end":3.26},{"text":"be","start":3.26,"end":3.34},{"text":"impacted","start":3.34,"end":3.72,"punct":"."},{"text":"That's","start":5.0,"end":5.32},{"text":"why","start":5.32,"end":5.48},{"text":"it's","start":5.48,"end":5.64},{"text":"urgent","start":5.64,"end":5.96},{"text":"that","start":5.96,"end":6.1},{"text":"we","start":6.1,"end":6.2},{"text":"begin","start":6.2,"end":6.44},{"text":"this","start":6.44,"end":6.62},{"text":"work","start":6.62,"end":6.84},{"text":"right","start":6.84,"end":7.12},{"text":"now","start":7.12,"end":8.1,"punct":"."},{"text":"Development","start":9.96,"end":10.44},{"text":"that","start":10.44,"end":10.7},{"text":"lifts","start":10.7,"end":10.88},{"text":"up","start":10.88,"end":11.08},{"text":"the","start